  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to support the Human Capital Development Programme for Bangladesh 2021 (HCDP-21)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim of this service contract is to support the relevant Bangladesh Government Bodies and the Delegation of the European Union to Bangladesh to develop the necessary enabling environment to reinforce institutional capacities to undertake effective, timely and evidence-based primary education and TVET reforms. The focus will be on well-targeted technical support, policy advice and evidence-based research.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
